-MemCellType: MRAM
-CellArea (F^2): 54
-CellAspectRatio: 2.0
-ResistanceOn (ohm): 3000
-ResistanceOff (ohm): 6000
-ReadMode: current
-ReadCurrent (uA): 40
-ReadPower (uW): 145
-ResetMode: current
-ResetCurrent (uA): 200
-ResetPulse (ns): 10
-SetMode: current
-SetCurrent (uA): 200
-SetPulse (ns): 10
-AccessType: CMOS
-AccessCMOSWidth (F): 6

# FIXED: the handout merges two directives onto one line as
#   -SetMode: current-SetCurrent (uA): 200
# NVSim then reads SetMode as the whole string and never sees SetCurrent.
#
# NOTE: this 16-line file omits fields the shipped sample_STTRAM.cell has:
#   -ReadVoltage (V): 0.25
#   -MinSenseVoltage (mV): 25
#   -VoltageDropAccessDevice (V): 0.15
#   -ResetEnergy (pJ) / -SetEnergy (pJ)
# Their absence is why Tasks 3 and 4 barely move. See README.
